    "m_FunctionName": "ComputeCrestFoam",
    "m_FunctionSource": "",
    "m_FunctionBody": "float waterDepth = SceneDepth - SurfaceDepth;\r\nfloat dt = waterDepth / (WaveHeight + CrestMaxDepth);\r\nfloat crestDepthFade = 1 - dt * dt * dt * dt * dt * dt * dt * dt; //1-x^8\r\nfloat crestFade = saturate(CrestMask/(1-CrestFoamStrength)); \r\n//crestFade = crestFade * (1 + FoamNoiseWS) * crestDepthFade;\r\ncrestFade = saturate(crestFade - FoamNoiseWS) * crestDepthFade;\r\nfloat crestClip = crestFade >= 0.5;\r\nfloat crestDepthClip = waterDepth <= (WaveHeight + CrestMaxDepth);\r\nfloat4 crestColorSharp = FoamColor * crestClip * (CrestFoamStrength > 0);\r\nfloat4 crestColorFade = FoamColor * crestFade * (CrestFoamStrength > 0);\r\n\nCrestFoamColorFade = crestColorFade*crestDepthClip;\nCrestFoamColorSharp = crestColorSharp;"
}

